&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryTabPreco DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryTabPreco :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

    OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} FOR EACH  {&TableName} NO-LOCK
                                WHERE {&TableName}.nr-tabpre = c-nr-tabpre.

    RETURN "OK":U.
END PROCEDURE.

